          "value": "<p><em>Saving Throw:</em> DC 20 Dexterity, each creature in a 30-foot Cone. <em>Failure:</em> 22 (4d10) Force damage and a creature's Speed is reduced to 0. <em>Failure by 5 or More:</em> A creature falls Unconscious for 1 minute. It wakes up early if it takes damage or another creature uses an action to shake it awake.</p>",
