    {
      "_id": "9iQe4snQ7QqJkg9t",
      "_key": "!actors.items!K3JKr2VyLZII9Zm6.9iQe4snQ7QqJkg9t",
      "name": "Release Specimen (Recharge 6)",
      "img": "icons/skills/melee/strike-weapons-orange.webp",
      "effects": [],
      "sort": 700,
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "flags": {},
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The Soul Hoarder opens a jar, releasing a specimen into an unoccupied space within 5 feet of it. The specimen is Charmed by the Soul Hoarder until either it or the Soul Hoarder is reduced to 0 Hit Points. The specimen takes its turn directly after the Soul Hoarder and follows its commands (no action required by the Soul Hoarder). The Soul Hoarder can recapture a released specimen as a Bonus Action.</p><p>When the Soul Hoarder releases a specimen, it chooses from one of the following options: Bulette, Otyugh, Salamander, Triceratops, Wraith. Once an option has been released, it can't be released again until the Soul Hoarder recaptures it.</p><p><em>Additional Specimens:</em> at the GM's discretion the collection may hold other creatures of CR 5 or lower; released creatures lose any Legendary Resistances or Legendary Actions.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
        "type": {
          "value": "monster",
          "subtype": ""
        },
        "activation": {
          "type": "action",
          "cost": 1,
          "condition": ""
        },
        "requirements": "",
        "uses": {
          "spent": 0,
          "recovery": []
        },
        "activities": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "sZMfMCFOMYL4XBYw",
      "_key": "!actors.items!K3JKr2VyLZII9Zm6.sZMfMCFOMYL4XBYw",
      "name": "Capture",
      "img": "icons/skills/melee/shield-damaged-broken-orange.webp",
      "effects": [],
      "sort": 800,
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "flags": {},
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><em>Trigger:</em> A creature within 60 feet of the Soul Hoarder falls Unconscious. <em>Response — Saving Throw:</em> DC 20 Constitution, the triggering creature. <em>Failure:</em> The target is imprisoned in one of the Soul Hoarder's jars. While in the jar, the target shrinks to fit inside and is Incapacitated. At the next dawn, the target is Charmed by the Soul Hoarder and can be released with its Release Specimen action.</p><p>The jar has AC 10 and 20 Hit Points. It has Three-Quarters Cover while held by the Soul Hoarder. Shattering the jar releases the specimen inside, which returns to its normal size and appears in the nearest unoccupied space within 5 feet of the jar.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
